,{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:3:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","kind":"text","role":"derivation","content":{"fragments":[{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:relative-pronoun","text":"that"},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:inner-subject","text":" you"},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:inner-verb","text":" gave"},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:indirect-object","text":" me"}],"caption":"关系代词放到从句开头"},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:ordinary-clause"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:3:3","op":"board.connect","connection":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:connection:book-to-that","from":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:ordinary-clause","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:ordinary-clause:fragment:direct-object"},"to":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:relative-pronoun"},"relation":"replaced_by","label":"the book → that"}},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:3:4","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:relative-pronoun"},"emphasis":"focus"}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:3:5","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-english-v2-001:node:ordinary-clause","lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure"],"intent":"derive_relative_pronoun_role"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:step:attach-and-reconstruct-clause:beat:label-inner-roles","narration":{"text":"现在每个成分都有依据：that 指代 book，在 gave 后缺失的位置充当直接宾语；you 是主语，gave 是谓语，me 是间接宾语。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:relative-pronoun"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:2","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:inner-subject"},"emphasis":"supporting"},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:3","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:inner-verb"},"emphasis":"supporting"},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:4","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure:fragment:indirect-object"},"emphasis":"supporting"},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:5","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-role-table","kind":"table","role":"evidence","content":{"title":"⑤ 从句内部成分","columns":["片段","作用"],"rows":[["that","关系代词 / 直接宾语"],["you","主语"],["gave","谓语"],["me","间接宾语"]]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","align":"center","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:3:4:6","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-structure","lesson-english-v2-001:node:relative-role-table"],"intent":"label_relative_clause_roles"}}]}}]}}
